  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As of \"SDK3 WORLD 2021.03.22.18.27\",\n2D audio seems no longer works on SDK3, If \"Enable Spatialization\" and \"Use AudioSource Volume Curve\" not checked and set to \"3D Spatial Blend\", near/far value seems set to either 0 or infinity invisibly by VRC_SpatialAudio Source component. It could dependant on AudioCurve as well so be checked.\n(Pic is just for reference which checkbox required to checked.)\n\nThis issue is not happen on SDK2, just SDK3 WORLD as I far as I can see.",
